accept-messageOf-caught-error: ACCEPT
accept-messageOf-thrown-error: ACCEPT
accept-messageOf-thrown-string: ACCEPT
accept-messageOf-number: ACCEPT
accept-messageOf-record-with-message: ACCEPT
accept-messageOf-undefined: ACCEPT
reject-e-message-on-unknown: REJECT m:rejected[no-member]
    m[no-member] property message on Js/unknown; narrow it first
reject-messageOf-as-value: REJECT m:rejected[prelude-value]
    m[prelude-value] messageOf is only called, as messageOf(...); as a value its calls would skip the rules of messageOf
